-alt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T01:38:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T01:38:25Z","body":"[A10] Round 2 assignment for PR #130. Executor [A398]; the same reviewers, [R374] and [R375]. Branch `127-srp-leaveall-at-transmit` at `cf4e5c63`.\n\nBoth round-1 reviews are NEGATIVE: [R374-1](https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pull/130#issuecomment-5861793313) and [R375-1](https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pull/130#issuecomment-5861714667). The parent consumer gates are 8/11 ([comment](https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/pull/130#issuecomment-5861561819)).\n\n**Required:**\n1. **R374-1 F1 = R375-1 F1 (MAJOR): the parent consumer gates.**\n   - Use the named construct instead of multi-declarators in `tb/srp_top/sim_main.cpp`.\n   - Annotate and document the public Python functions in `tb/srp_top/mutants.py`, and wrap its long lines.\n   - Bound the mutation driver by DUT cycles, not host wall-clock time.\n   - Either remove the DUT-source reader, or explain it in the evidence tool's terms.\n   - Run the parent's rule-11 and rule-12 checkers and `measure_test_evidence.py --check` against this tree before REVIEW READY. The manager re-runs the full consumer set.\n2. **R374-1 F2 = R375-1 F2: the supersession and intent guards.**\n   - Add committed `srp_top` cases for: a peer LeaveAll while preparation waits behind a busy encoder; a newer own expiry while a canceled preparation is still blocked; a peer decoded on the join-opportunity clock (−1/0/+1); a peer on the reuse-acceptance clock of a retained reservation; and a sink-plane Talker Lv at −1/0/+1 around acceptance.\n   - Each reviewer mutant (`my-join-edge-peer`, `my-cancel-eats-new-intent`, `my-reuse-flags-ignore-cancel`, `r-cancel-latch-dropped`, `r-cancel-consumes-new-intent`, `r-join-start-guard-dropped`, `r-sink-receive-priority-lost`) fails a named assertion in the committed suite and is recorded in the campaign table.\n\n**Taken suggestions:**\n- R375-1 F3: pin the join-tick coalescing and the same-cycle MVRP/prepare arbitration, or state them as intended limits; also fix the README count.\n- R374-1 F3: bound or fix the canceled-empty-reservation TX-slot hold. Releasing the handle when a canceled round is empty is preferred, if it is local and safe; otherwise document the bound.\n- R374-1 F4 = R375-1 F4: publish the parent replay harness sources with their recorded hashes in your output directory; the manager archives them.\n   - **Manager decision:** the deadline-anchored oracle is the accepted proof. Under the #608 IN-registrar decision, the unmodified helper's LV-anchored race is the legitimate post-`sLA` LV path.\n\n**Unchanged:**\n- LV + rLv semantics and #108 are unchanged.\n- Do not edit or delete any existing comment.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/5861796018/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/5861803695","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/127#issuecomment-5861803695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/127","id":5861803695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOT06kyc8AAAABXWQGrw","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-